THE ZONE GEOMETRY IS PUBLIC DOMAIN
----------------------------------

The forecast zone boundaries in zones_main.json, zones_marine.json and the
geometry carried in zones_patches.json are produced by the National Weather
Service, an agency of the United States government, and are in the public
domain.

No licence is needed to use them, and none is granted here because none is
required. Nothing in this file restricts them, and no claim is made over them.
Use them freely.


